sentences.text:
Considering the facts and circumstances of the case, the petitioner is admitted to bail on furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) with one surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of the learned trial court and subject to the following conditions:
(i) Petitioner shall provide his mobile number to the Investigating Officer (IO) / SHO concerned.
(ii) Petitioner shall not threaten or influence the witnesses in any manner;

